{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "7d93a6b6-6b9e-571b-be2e-445936c1dd67", "source_ordinal": 4281, "reading_ordinal": 4066, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "哭而不答", "published_at": "2026-07-21T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2061391637109010870/answer/2061915210198340455"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "index": 1, "text": "小孩今年二年级，最近刚刚放暑假。白天都给孩子送去托管班，托管的同时也会补下学期的课程，晚上就在家里写作业等等。前几天孩子晚上还补课，我就在孩子房间用她的书桌练字。练字的时候随手在孩子桌上的草稿纸篮里拿了张纸，没想到就发现了孩子在纸上画的一些很幼稚的漫画，里面的对话似乎都是和班级同学有关，但是却是毫无逻辑的那种。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 156}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "“很幼稚”“毫无逻辑”——其实已经带上了鄙视和嫌弃。", "char_start": 157, "char_end": 183}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "quote", "index": 3, "text": "（真的没想到她还在藏，放在草稿纸堆中就是不让我发现）", "char_start": 184, "char_end": 210}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "你如何断定她是故意放在草稿纸堆里的呢？为什么不可能是画了随手放的？", "char_start": 211, "char_end": 244}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "即使是“故意藏在草稿纸堆”里，这又有多大的罪呢？是因为你规定了“任何事情都不许瞒着我”吗？", "char_start": 245, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "quote", "index": 6, "text": "等她回家之后，我绝对没有发任何火，", "char_start": 291, "char_end": 308}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "你的意思是，这次你觉得自己还没发任何火，是吗？", "char_start": 309, "char_end": 332}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "quote", "index": 8, "text": "只是问她“你为什么画这些？写这些的时候是怎么想的？”，甚至语气都很平和，", "char_start": 333, "char_end": 369}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "注意到了吗？你问的不是“宝宝画的这是个什么故事”“这个是不是张小胖”，而是“这些”。", "char_start": 370, "char_end": 412}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "意思是你已经断定了这是什么，你只是想知道动机。", "char_start": 413, "char_end": 436}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "罪已经定了，她最多有点机会靠坦白争取从宽，是吗？", "char_start": 437, "char_end": 461}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "quote", "index": 12, "text": "结果孩子就宁可在那里抽泣、哭也不回答。", "char_start": 462, "char_end": 481}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "她已经望见了这结果，知道这剧情熟悉的开端会走向什么结局，已经害怕到不能自已了。", "char_start": 482, "char_end": 521}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "quote", "index": 14, "text": "真的就不明白，我只是问问，又没说不让她画，她要是说出来个所以然来我们会大力支持！", "char_start": 522, "char_end": 562}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你的想法是好的，但是你想过吗？几岁的孩子，如果没有大人的耐心帮助，甚至连“说出个所以然”所需要的单词都凑不齐。", "char_start": 563, "char_end": 618}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "她还不知道很多词的用法，连给自己的感受取个名字都困难，你不站在她那一边抱着她，安慰着她，帮助她，却站在她的对面，以敌人的姿态让她孤零零的自己说出个所以然，她连原本的平静都被恐惧夺走，如何做得到啊。", "char_start": 619, "char_end": 717}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "quote", "index": 17, "text": "为什么孩子宁可选择对抗的方式去哭闹，也不能好好地回答问题呢？", "char_start": 718, "char_end": 748}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "孩子根本就没有“选择”去哭闹，你明白吗？", "char_start": 749, "char_end": 769}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "她只是很客观的被放在了一个她应付不了的高压力环境里，被迫发生了本能的应激反应。", "char_start": 770, "char_end": 809}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "她没有“选择”什么，她不是故意的。", "char_start": 810, "char_end": 827}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "明白吗？", "char_start": 828, "char_end": 832}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "你想知道这些画的是什么，她想了什么，这几条一定要做到：", "char_start": 833, "char_end": 860}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "1）不知者不为罪，这是正义的通行法则。因此，低于一定年龄的孩子——尤其是学龄前儿童——出于无知的荫蔽，是根本没有“罪过”可言的。", "char_start": 861, "char_end": 925}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这段时间，对孩子不可以有任何惩罚、报复性质的行为，可以有严肃的告诫（例如“宝宝千万不要离开妈妈的视线”）、坚定的阻止（例如坚定的拿走对孩子危险的玩具、坚定的拒绝ta不合适的请求），但不能惩罚。", "char_start": 926, "char_end": 1022}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "不能逼着根本没明白自己错在哪里的孩子为自己无法理解的“罪行”不断的受罚。那不会让ta们快速“懂事”，而只会让ta们恐惧父母。", "char_start": 1023, "char_end": 1085}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "你是ta们唯一的依靠，你却变成了ta们莫名恐惧的源泉，这怎么得了？", "char_start": 1086, "char_end": 1119}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "2）孩子需要很多直接的信号来获得安全感，来得到友善的保证。ta们配合你的一切前提都是ta们觉得现在环境足够安全，所以温柔总是比威严更好的答案。", "char_start": 1120, "char_end": 1191}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "抱抱ta，亲亲ta，用乳名呼唤ta，这对孩子而言，才是你“没有发火”的直观信号。只要缺了这些信号，仅仅是没有成人意义上的愤怒用词是不够的。语气平静，只是冷漠冰冷的代名词。", "char_start": 1192, "char_end": 1277}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "有缘看到这篇的，早点改过吧。", "char_start": 1278, "char_end": 1292}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"quote": 7, "paragraph": 22}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0579"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：孩子画一些没什么意义的东西，我只是心平气和地问问她，她为什么宁可哭也不回答？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029"], "summary": "围绕“哭而不答”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“小孩今年二年级，最近刚刚放暑假。白天都给孩子送去托管班，托管的同时也会补下学期的课程，晚上就在家里写作业等等。前几天孩子晚上还补课，我就在孩子房间用她的书桌练字。练字的时候随手在孩子桌上的草稿纸篮里拿了张纸，没想到就发现了孩子在纸上画的一些很幼稚的漫画，里面的对话似乎都是和班级同学有关，但是却是毫无逻辑的那种。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "quote", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "小孩今年二年级，最近刚刚放暑假。白天都给孩子送去托管班，托管的同时也会补下学期的课程，晚上就在家里写作业等等。前几天孩子晚上还补课，我就在孩子房间用她的书桌练字。练字的时候随手在孩子桌上的草稿纸篮里拿了张纸，没想到就发现了孩子在纸上画的一些很幼稚的漫画，里面的对话似乎都是和班级同学有关，但是却是毫无逻辑的那种。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 156, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8f665244-d87a-5024-b932-5018c88f4d8e", "source_ordinal": 4279, "reading_ordinal": 4067, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "学霸的错题", "published_at": "2026-07-21T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2013599119655055615/answer/2061480231362471825"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "先不谈学霸是不是真的没有错题本，只说一个问题——你可以通过不设错题本，自动变成学霸吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "普通人学习，第一步还是老老实实走普通正统的道路，用中正和平的方法。", "char_start": 44, "char_end": 77}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "你可以对传统的错题本逻辑有些改良，提升——比如习题集一次买两本，错一道在没做的那边标一道，过上一周等直接印象淡了再做；可以用数字手段，拍照识别，一键入库；可以提高入库标准，只把自己错得最意外的题入库……", "char_start": 78, "char_end": 179}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "但不要用什么“学霸都没有用错题本”来决定你也不该用错题本。你最好的选择还是从低处做起，永远从零开始。", "char_start": 180, "char_end": 230}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "如果你真是天才，你从低处着手，自然可以不断的简化、提高这个方法的效率，很快你就可以凭着足够的成绩客观上让错题出现得越来越少，逐渐变得不必要，但这应该是正面穿透了传统过程的结果，而不是靠跳过这个过程来直接“拥有学霸的样子”。", "char_start": 231, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "举点例子——我们设计歼-20的时候，也没有因为“F-22、YF-23、Su-57都没有鸭翼”而决定“坚决不能搞鸭翼”。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 402}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "人家不搞鸭翼，是因为人家发动机厉害，制造体系积累深。", "char_start": 403, "char_end": 429}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "我们发动机没那么强，该上鸭翼就上。能飞起来、能打是第一位的。", "char_start": 430, "char_end": 460}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "谦卑一点，脚踏实地，飞起来、打起来再说。飞好了，打稳了，我们发动机也起来了，经验也足了，我们也可以走无鸭翼的方案。", "char_start": 461, "char_end": 518}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "别说鸭翼，尾翼都可以不要。", "char_start": 519, "char_end": 532}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "如果我们一开始就迷信什么“好飞机都没有鸭翼”的鬼话，别说六代机，五代机现在都可能还在车间里试车。", "char_start": 533, "char_end": 581}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "错题本可能对学霸不必要，但你还不是学霸。", "char_start": 582, "char_end": 602}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "一个卓越的人，最该学会的就是不要在一开始假设自己是天才。", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 631}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 13}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0579"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么学霸总是没有错题本？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013"], "summary": "围绕“学霸的错题”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“先不谈学霸是不是真的没有错题本，只说一个问题——你可以通过不设错题本，自动变成学霸吗？”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "先不谈学霸是不是真的没有错题本，只说一个问题——你可以通过不设错题本，自动变成学霸吗？", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 43, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "9c3122cd-b76f-575e-b7ca-6e3f78eb275c", "source_ordinal": 4280, "reading_ordinal": 4068, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "问题之问题", "published_at": "2026-07-21T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2026935663937745322/answer/2061237446348632154"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "首先，并不是所有的问题都能用AI解决。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "1）你不能提供正确情报、AI自己也找不到正确情报的问题，AI无法解决——例如“如何消除厄尔尼诺现象”。", "char_start": 20, "char_end": 71}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "2）没有万无一失的方法可借鉴的问题，AI没法解决——例如ta为什么不爱你。", "char_start": 72, "char_end": 109}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "3）没有所谓正确的定义的问题，AI没法解决——例如“如何实现正义”。", "char_start": 110, "char_end": 144}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "4）你和AI都没有发现的问题，AI没法解决。你也没想过问题存在，AI也没能推算到问题的存在，自然也就谈不上解决。这个例子嘛，我知道，但我就不告诉你，你猜？你让AI猜？", "char_start": 145, "char_end": 228}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其次，AI解决了问题，但这个解决会带来新的问题。", "char_start": 229, "char_end": 253}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "就像粮食不愁吃了，肥胖就成了问题；肥胖不愁治了，贫穷就成了问题；贫穷被消灭了，空虚就成了问题……", "char_start": 254, "char_end": 302}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "不幸福，幸福就成了问题。", "char_start": 303, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "幸福了，不能更幸福就成了问题。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 331}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "更幸福了，不能一直幸福就成了问题。", "char_start": 332, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "问题是孤雌繁殖、自然裂变的。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 364}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "历史不休，问题不止。", "char_start": 365, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "就不说别的——人类走向太空，立刻就会带来大量需要从做实验、测数据开始的问题，全都没经验、没答案，你让AI上哪借鉴经验？", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "第三，AI本身就会带来问题——比如“所有问题AI都解决了，读书还有什么用”这个问题。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 478}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "我相信你提问时已经问过了，AI给的答案你不满意，才有了这个问题，不是吗？", "char_start": 479, "char_end": 515}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "所以“AI解决一切问题”这事不成立，你还是得读书。", "char_start": 516, "char_end": 541}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "别说“AI知道就行”，你不知道，你就不知道AI是不是真知道。", "char_start": 542, "char_end": 572}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "你必须得学。", "char_start": 573, "char_end": 579}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 19}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0579"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：现在所有的问题都能用AI解决，那读书的意义何在?；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018"], "summary": "围绕“问题之问题”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“首先，并不是所有的问题都能用AI解决。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "首先，并不是所有的问题都能用AI解决。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 19, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "67231fc3-fd70-534b-b395-840ab39535d3", "source_ordinal": 4278, "reading_ordinal": 4069, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "通而融", "published_at": "2026-07-22T07:00:00+08:00", "platform": "afdian", "url": "https://www.ifdian.net/p/0ad75a6c7fc611f1ae6152540025c377"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "第一个问题——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "如果以后想在职场上有所发展，就要根除一个坏毛病：只有你自己负责或有权直接制定、修改、执行、监督、奖惩的规则，你才有立场判定“不合理”。", "char_start": 8, "char_end": 75}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "举个例子，你是总经理，按照章程你可以直接修改办公室主任制定的打印纸使用规范，这个时候，你可以没有什么后患的说“这个规矩不合理”；你自己制定了一个迟到条例，你自己发现效果有问题，你自己在会议上可以说“现在看来这个条例不太合理”。", "char_start": 76, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "只要不属于这种情况，只要这个规矩不是你定的、你也没有正式的权力去直接修改，你就不要谈“不合理”，而要说“我难以执行”“我难以配合”“我需要指导”。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 263}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "绝对不要乱说“不合理”。", "char_start": 264, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "因为在没有特殊授权（例如在会议上盛邀大家给反馈）的前提下，“质疑规矩不合理于是拒不配合”是对规则制定者最极端的冒犯之一，几乎是铁定要上黑名单的。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 349}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "heading", "index": 7, "text": "这约等于指着规则制定者的鼻子骂ta是傻x。", "char_start": 350, "char_end": 371}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "是的，就是这么严重。", "char_start": 372, "char_end": 382}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "不要相信什么“这是我的正当权利”——这就算是你的正当权利，也不影响对方会被激怒而且可能对你采取敌对态度。", "char_start": 383, "char_end": 435}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "ta手里完全正当的伤害你的手段太多了，很多都是无色无味的——例如在年终考核时交代你上司一句，你的绩效就可能因为完全冠冕堂皇的理由减等。甚至遇上“明白人”型的上司，对方还会主动的把你减等，作为“建设上级关系”的心意小礼品。", "char_start": 436, "char_end": 546}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "再说一遍，你自己的立的规矩，你可以说不合理，别人立的规矩，你没资格说不合理。", "char_start": 547, "char_end": 585}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "这种习惯从哪来的？", "char_start": 586, "char_end": 595}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "三个来源——", "char_start": 596, "char_end": 602}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "一个是从人长期批评政府政策、行政法规的习惯上来的。但人往往忘记——作为民主国家、原则上所有的规矩都是你同时参与制定了的，从法理学来说，是你作为总股东之一委派了一群人在帮你立法、执法，所以作为总股东，你可以对这些公共事务有天然的评价权。", "char_start": 603, "char_end": 720}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "这绝不是一个“评价权自然普遍存在”的例证、反而恰恰是“评价权一定来自所有权”的例证。", "char_start": 721, "char_end": 763}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "事实上，你天然的就懂这个道理——因为一不让你批评这些行政决策，你就会本能的脱口而出“这是人民的国家，我是人民”——你天然的就知道这是因为你有这个权利合法性来源。", "char_start": 764, "char_end": 844}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "评价权来自所有权和基于所有权的转授，不是凭空掉下来的，也不是“谁看到什么事都可以评价”。", "char_start": 845, "char_end": 889}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "第二是从父母就可以肆无忌惮的评点自己的一切“不合理”的观察中来的，但父母当然也是有社会的集体授权才享有的这个“泛审判权”。", "char_start": 890, "char_end": 951}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "第三，就是作为消费者，你经常理直气壮的评点你买到的产品和服务不合理。但你应该已经看到规律了——那是因为经过购买，你拥有了所有权。", "char_start": 952, "char_end": 1016}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "你可能要问：“那么我对没有购买的商品和服务也有批判权啊”——那其实是厂商贪图你的购买意愿而做的贿赂。", "char_start": 1017, "char_end": 1067}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "一旦证实你没有购买意愿而且目的就是破坏其他人的购买意愿，人家是要告诽谤的。", "char_start": 1068, "char_end": 1105}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "看明白了这个，回头看你在企业中、社会上的处境，你就知道犯这种错误有多危险。", "char_start": 1106, "char_end": 1143}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "规则让人不方便的时候，规则的制定者只能接受你忍受不方便去服从规则，而绝不能接受你以自己的方便为优先而无视规则。", "char_start": 1144, "char_end": 1199}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "因为ta只要在这个原则上退让一步，ta所有的规则就都无效了——谁都顺着自己的方便，撂下一句“不合理”就可以自行其是，自己不但得不到必要的配合，还要落一个“傻x”的罪名——这么说吧，就得罪人而言，少有比这更糟糕的做法了。", "char_start": 1200, "char_end": 1309}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "运气最好的结果是对方不做上报，否则上报了你就只有不等批评处置，主动去道歉检讨一条路了。", "char_start": 1310, "char_end": 1353}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "别等着“有追究再检讨不迟”——真要处置未必会明着“追究”，人家可能顾虑这人连这点规矩都不懂，批评ta恐怕ta要犯浑，索性直接想别的手段处理。", "char_start": 1354, "char_end": 1424}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "现在再谈你遇到这种规矩导致巨大不便的情况要怎么办。", "char_start": 1425, "char_end": 1450}, {"paragraph_id": "P028", "field": "body", "index": 28, "text": "1）绝对不要说什么不合理，只说“有困难，请告诉我怎么处理”。", "char_start": 1451, "char_end": 1481}, {"paragraph_id": "P029", "field": "body", "index": 29, "text": "你坚持这个立场，协调矛盾的压力就在执法者和立法者。", "char_start": 1482, "char_end": 1507}, {"paragraph_id": "P030", "field": "body", "index": 30, "text": "理想而言，此时执法者应该去向立法者请示。", "char_start": 1508, "char_end": 1528}, {"paragraph_id": "P031", "field": "body", "index": 31, "text": "但是恰恰因为ta不方便请示，你才有了操作变通的空间。", "char_start": 1529, "char_end": 1555}, {"paragraph_id": "P032", "field": "body", "index": 32, "text": "2）和不愿麻烦扩大化的执行者商量折中方案。", "char_start": 1556, "char_end": 1577}, {"paragraph_id": "P033", "field": "body", "index": 33, "text": "ta该请示而没请示，造成了你的损失，ta也可能受批评和责罚，所以ta是有动力和你协商权宜之计的。如果你再添上一些激励——例如承诺答谢、承诺自己负责、绝对保密——对方很容易和你达成私下合作，保证你既不受损失，ta也好交差。", "char_start": 1578, "char_end": 1688}, {"paragraph_id": "P034", "field": "body", "index": 34, "text": "你只是一定要意识到，这是你在私下里请人帮忙，对方为你担了干系，这事不能大肆宣扬，你要念人的好，绝不能自认为理直气壮，对方应该配合，不配合就是岂有此理，那样你不但得不到通融，还可能逼着对方严格执行。", "char_start": 1689, "char_end": 1787}, {"paragraph_id": "P035", "field": "body", "index": 35, "text": "拿住这个分寸，你的职业道路会顺畅很多，祝你好运。", "char_start": 1788, "char_end": 1812}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 34, "heading": 1}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0579"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：面对不合理的现场指令，普通员工有什么合规的应对方式？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027", "P028", "P029", "P030", "P031", "P032", "P033", "P034", "P035"], "summary": "围绕“通而融”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“第一个问题——”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "第一个问题——", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 7, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "a9f480d3-443d-5550-bce7-e97ac65c467c", "source_ordinal": 4277, "reading_ordinal": 4070, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无价通宝", "published_at": "2026-07-22T12:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2042271988564186432/answer/2043002366732001711"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "这是个典型的误解——金属货币之间的相互兑换比率不是设计出来的，而是一套复杂的经济体系动态评估的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "我们太习惯元、角、分这样的分级货币结构，在本能意识里，会认为这就是同一种货币的三种表现形式。就像“一头猪”和“拆成里脊、蹄膀、大排的猪部位”以及“切成块、片、丝的猪肉”的关系一样。", "char_start": 49, "char_end": 139}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "然而金属货币完全不是这样一种存在。", "char_start": 140, "char_end": 157}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "在那种花纹极为复杂的压铸货币出现之前，制作金属货币是任何一个拥有熔炉，有足够多柴炭可烧的熟手匠人都可以办到的简单操作。", "char_start": 158, "char_end": 217}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "这工艺有多简单？拿出样本钱用粘土包住就可以做出钱范，然后就一批批的铸了就行。", "char_start": 218, "char_end": 256}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "看上去有点问题不打紧，做旧、做残，保证最后乌漆麻黑、字迹模糊，就像真钱一样。", "char_start": 257, "char_end": 295}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "真钱就是这样乌漆麻黑、字迹模糊的样子。", "char_start": 296, "char_end": 315}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "至于说钱的色彩，这只是个铜锡锌镍铅的配色问题。", "char_start": 316, "char_end": 339}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "你凭啥说我这是假钱？不信你拿斧头剁开看是铜不是？至于说颜色有点暗，你见过四川宝泉局的通宝没？川钱、滇钱就这个色。天下三十六家造币厂，每年还有批次差异，“真钱”的取值范围大到没人摸得到边。要说一枚铜钱是假币，真的有点困难。", "char_start": 340, "char_end": 450}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "你官方规定这个钱兑那个钱1:5是吧？", "char_start": 451, "char_end": 469}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "那我收三个小钱，做一个大钱，找你买一文小钱的东西请你再找我四文。只要你肯接，我发财有多快只取决于我烧炭有多快。", "char_start": 470, "char_end": 525}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "换言之，金属货币的实际兑换率其实是熔炉决定的，谁的规定严重的偏离这个实际汇率，就会触发大量的回炉私铸行为。", "char_start": 526, "char_end": 579}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "只要几种货币的材质一样，它们的兑换率就会严格的由成分决定，由不得你在面值上写通宝、重宝、元宝、当十、当百、当千来一厢情愿的限定。", "char_start": 580, "char_end": 644}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "这就引出了另一个策略，那就是不同面值的硬币直接用不同金属来做，比如五分钱是铝的，五毛钱是铜的，一块钱是钢的。", "char_start": 645, "char_end": 699}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "但这样一来反而还把问题更复杂化了，因为这行不同金属之间的交易价格就会影响到不同币种之间的实际兑换率了。", "char_start": 700, "char_end": 751}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "德国银便宜铜贵而土耳其铜便宜银贵的问题，就会导致跨境金属交易可以通过铸币来套利。", "char_start": 752, "char_end": 792}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "这里新发现一个铜矿，那里又抢了一个南美国家宝藏之类的突发大额金属供应同样会引起兑换比率波动。", "char_start": 793, "char_end": 839}, {"paragraph_id": "P018", "field": "body", "index": 18, "text": "这个问题，在罗马征服期间就已经严重得一塌糊涂了。最后西方人的意识里就形成了一个完全不同的货币意识，那就是不同材质、不同名字的货币之间其实根本就毫无关联，其兑换率一向都是随行就市，全看老板心情。", "char_start": 840, "char_end": 936}, {"paragraph_id": "P019", "field": "body", "index": 19, "text": "其结果就市金属货币上干脆不印面值，只印货币名，面额全是1，根本没有两元、五元这种概念。德拉克马是德拉克马，弗洛林是弗洛林。你要五弗洛林，拿到的一定是五个弗洛林硬币，而不是一个面值为“5弗洛林”的大钱。", "char_start": 937, "char_end": 1037}, {"paragraph_id": "P020", "field": "body", "index": 20, "text": "至于一弗洛林兑几德拉克马、又兑几畿尼，你问老板，卖酒的老板说是几就是几，卖肉的老板说是几就是几。", "char_start": 1038, "char_end": 1086}, {"paragraph_id": "P021", "field": "body", "index": 21, "text": "然而你真去问这些老板呢，老板们往往压根就不回答，第一他难得算，第二他要把你这奇奇怪怪的货币用出去还要承担风险。", "char_start": 1087, "char_end": 1142}, {"paragraph_id": "P022", "field": "body", "index": 22, "text": "他们宁可我这啤酒就卖五个便士我就只收便士。你要用金畿尼来买啤酒，我这真伺候不了，请你先去兑换处自己兑好了便士再来。", "char_start": 1143, "char_end": 1200}, {"paragraph_id": "P023", "field": "body", "index": 23, "text": "根本就没有“此币固定换几个彼币”这个概念。", "char_start": 1201, "char_end": 1222}, {"paragraph_id": "P024", "field": "body", "index": 24, "text": "这个问题还不是只发生在本国货币和外国货币之间，自己本国发行的金银铜镍币，甚至不同版本的金币与金币、银币与银币之间一样如此。", "char_start": 1223, "char_end": 1284}, {"paragraph_id": "P025", "field": "body", "index": 25, "text": "严格说起来，这个动作根本就不叫“兑换”，而就是赤裸裸的易货贸易、是买卖。", "char_start": 1285, "char_end": 1321}, {"paragraph_id": "P026", "field": "body", "index": 26, "text": "所以本题里的这个问法就问错了——这个比值根本就不是银行规定、不是设计的，谁要这两种币就是各自这个价呢？", "char_start": 1322, "char_end": 1373}, {"paragraph_id": "P027", "field": "body", "index": 27, "text": "是多少就得是多少，没带小数点已经算很仁慈了。", "char_start": 1374, "char_end": 1396}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 27}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0579"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：《哈利波特》中1加隆=17银西可，1银西可=29纳特，jk罗琳为什么设计了一种难以快速计算的货币体系？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017", "P018", "P019", "P020", "P021", "P022", "P023", "P024", "P025", "P026", "P027"], "summary": "围绕“无价通宝”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“这是个典型的误解——金属货币之间的相互兑换比率不是设计出来的，而是一套复杂的经济体系动态评估的。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "这是个典型的误解——金属货币之间的相互兑换比率不是设计出来的，而是一套复杂的经济体系动态评估的。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 48, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "053877e9-83f9-520e-937e-71e6f94b3021", "source_ordinal": 4270, "reading_ordinal": 4071, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "问不起", "published_at": "2026-07-22T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2046602314325268215/answer/2062550422443888651"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "请你相信，这些问题没有哪个是为了刁难你，而是ta的领导、ta的客户也会问ta的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "ta“刁难”你的时候，考虑的根本不是让你如何难看，好去建立什么权威，而是在脑海里模拟着客户和上司问自己这些问题的时候，自己能不能做到以下三条：", "char_start": 43, "char_end": 114}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "1）一切关键的，都可以直接在PPT上找到。", "char_start": 115, "char_end": 136}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "2）PPT上找不到的，一定都不关键，上司和客户可以接受ta稍微核实一下再回答。", "char_start": 137, "char_end": 176}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "3）PPT上找不到的细节，公司里的相关负责人一定清楚，自己只要一个电话就可以核实。", "char_start": 177, "char_end": 218}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "重要的我一定要知道，我不知道的一定不重要，我不知道的一定有人知道——这三条合起来就是上司们所谓的“心里有底”。", "char_start": 219, "char_end": 274}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "这个底，是ta们在客户、在上司面前说话硬气的根本保障，关系到企业的信誉和品牌价值，是绝不能开玩笑的核心问题。", "char_start": 275, "char_end": 329}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "所以要用突击抽查和严厉训斥、惩罚来确保从上到下都保持严谨态度，杜绝loose end。", "char_start": 330, "char_end": 373}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "绝不允许有什么有关细节挖到具体撰稿人了居然是没答案的，因为ta在客户面前说了那句“具体的精确数据我核实一下尽快答复您”之后，一旦散会，这个倒计时就是以小时计的。", "char_start": 374, "char_end": 454}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "半小时一小时就能核实，和一天后才能核实，和一周后才能核实，这造成的印象已然不同。", "char_start": 455, "char_end": 495}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "更糟糕的是，这还不是一个“当时问了什么数字就报什么数字”的工作，而是要防着对方知道这个答案后立刻给出追问，你难道让ta回答“那我再核实核实”？你得把这个当时答不出来的问题的整个周边问题一起核实，一起准备。", "char_start": 496, "char_end": 598}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "要down to the earth，挖到物理基座上，形成闭环解释才行。而这种准备，如果不是先有工作做在前，接到电话才开始如梦方醒的补课，是很难一个半天就敢说准备好了的。", "char_start": 599, "char_end": 684}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "所以在内部自审的时候，让大领导揪出这样一个薄弱点，对大领导造成的恐惧是深可见骨的，甚至可以影响到ta对相关负责人的基本信任，不挨骂是不可能的。", "char_start": 685, "char_end": 756}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你都找我汇报了，你就不能只对PPT上写了的东西负责，这PPT相关的周边一切情况你都要负责，我抽查必须验证这一点，否则以后你的报告我怎么信？", "char_start": 757, "char_end": 826}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你觉得这是吹毛求疵，是因为你没有直接面对客户，没体会过这种煎熬。", "char_start": 827, "char_end": 859}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "将来也许有机会明白的。", "char_start": 860, "char_end": 871}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 16}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0579"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：给大领导汇报工作，领导经常性抓到一个点就使劲往细节问，直到问答不上，该如何应对呢？这种现象正常吗？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016"], "summary": "围绕“问不起”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“请你相信，这些问题没有哪个是为了刁难你，而是ta的领导、ta的客户也会问ta的问题。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "请你相信，这些问题没有哪个是为了刁难你，而是ta的领导、ta的客户也会问ta的问题。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 42, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "1244b41d-bc76-5c60-9228-b951cddfa124", "source_ordinal": 4275, "reading_ordinal": 4072, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "无谓爱", "published_at": "2026-07-22T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/35480487/answer/2016695204896342905"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 2}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "胡扯淡的东西。", "char_start": 3, "char_end": 10}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "爱情这东西其实根本都不在乎什么承诺。", "char_start": 11, "char_end": 29}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "因为已经下定了必死的决心，无论什么身败名裂、粉身碎骨的威胁都已经置之度外，所以已经完全不受任何世俗判断、物质得失的左右了。", "char_start": 30, "char_end": 91}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "也恰恰是因为这份将一切都置之度外的彻底的决绝，带来了常人在常时无法想象的自由和享乐。", "char_start": 92, "char_end": 134}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "我将如樱花为你凋落，舍弃一切铺平你的道路，不必你理解，也不必你感激，甚至不需要你知道。", "char_start": 135, "char_end": 178}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "什么他妈的“承诺”？", "char_start": 179, "char_end": 189}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你如果觉得我给你的东西是为了换你什么承诺，甚至自认为这个什么承诺可以抵得过我所做的，仅仅是因为这个愚昧的念头，你就根本不配我为你如此。", "char_start": 190, "char_end": 257}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "写这个“三角理论”的人懂个啥子爱情。", "char_start": 258, "char_end": 276}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "他根本不知道自己在说什么。", "char_start": 277, "char_end": 290}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "不要误会，这不是在为爱情唱赞歌，这种核聚变级别的激情迸发如果没有善良作保，不一定会造成什么样的灾难。", "char_start": 292, "char_end": 342}, {"paragraph_id": "P012", "field": "body", "index": 12, "text": "哈莉奎因和小丑、邦妮和克莱德这样的关系就是这种激情迸发的案例。", "char_start": 343, "char_end": 374}, {"paragraph_id": "P013", "field": "body", "index": 13, "text": "这东西无坚不摧，无往不利，问题是它是不受道德约束也不在乎社会规范的。", "char_start": 375, "char_end": 409}, {"paragraph_id": "P014", "field": "body", "index": 14, "text": "你甚至很难确定它能不能算一件好事。", "char_start": 410, "char_end": 427}, {"paragraph_id": "P015", "field": "body", "index": 15, "text": "你得在它到来之前先把对人类的爱铸进灵魂的底里，否则等它来了，一切就难说了。", "char_start": 428, "char_end": 465}, {"paragraph_id": "P016", "field": "body", "index": 16, "text": "没有善良作保，爱情往往酿成对自己和他人的悲剧。这就像炸药想不伤人，非有极其复杂的训练和小心的处置不可。", "char_start": 466, "char_end": 517}, {"paragraph_id": "P017", "field": "body", "index": 17, "text": "爱情是极度易燃易爆的危险品，你还是先学会基本abc再说吧。", "char_start": 518, "char_end": 547}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 18}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0579"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：如何看待心理学家斯腾伯格提出的爱情三角理论？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011", "P012", "P013", "P014", "P015", "P016", "P017"], "summary": "围绕“无谓爱”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“……”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "……", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 2, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
{"record_type": "article_reading", "schema_version": "0.2.0", "corpus_sha256": "E8617186FB3A82FD117C790499191B0E7B14D7A0C06E084C6D91CB5C5BF6AAA4", "article_id": "8e11bbb1-580d-5b27-9680-4c3e6206fa00", "source_ordinal": 4273, "reading_ordinal": 4073, "source_version": "v2-current", "metadata": {"title": "海公奈何", "published_at": "2026-07-22T19:00:00+08:00", "platform": "zhihu", "url": "https://www.zhihu.com/question/2059747709331027510/answer/2062948514435424681"}, "structure": {"full_text_checked": true, "paragraphs": [{"paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "index": 1, "text": "不要自作多情，没有谁在争取把你变愚蠢，ta们只是尝试从你一切的欲望中盈利。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37}, {"paragraph_id": "P002", "field": "body", "index": 2, "text": "其盈利的主要模式就是把你的欲望打包成越来越容易实现的准成品，让你需要出的力、冒的险越来越少，最好少到只要一冲动就可以成交。", "char_start": 38, "char_end": 99}, {"paragraph_id": "P003", "field": "body", "index": 3, "text": "这是你自己希望、自己奖励出来的。", "char_start": 100, "char_end": 116}, {"paragraph_id": "P004", "field": "body", "index": 4, "text": "凡是这样做的供应商都拿到了你的合同，不这样做的供应商都会被你冷落和拒绝，你现在却要怪人“合力想让我变得愚蠢”？", "char_start": 117, "char_end": 172}, {"paragraph_id": "P005", "field": "body", "index": 5, "text": "两头都是理是吧你？", "char_start": 173, "char_end": 182}, {"paragraph_id": "P006", "field": "body", "index": 6, "text": "其实这个安排原本很和谐——天地万物为你效力，帮你把一切繁琐简化到只要点头摇头、点击发送、Hi Siri，把你解放出来，让你去从事你本来应该背负的天命。", "char_start": 183, "char_end": 258}, {"paragraph_id": "P007", "field": "body", "index": 7, "text": "只是这事出了差错——别说天命，你连媳妇都不背。", "char_start": 259, "char_end": 282}, {"paragraph_id": "P008", "field": "body", "index": 8, "text": "你没了“在一边愚蠢，好在另一边聪明”的理由。", "char_start": 283, "char_end": 305}, {"paragraph_id": "P009", "field": "body", "index": 9, "text": "只剩下了“在一边愚蠢，在另一边为愚蠢焦虑”。", "char_start": 306, "char_end": 328}, {"paragraph_id": "P010", "field": "body", "index": 10, "text": "皇上军国大事不操心，东夷西狄不征讨，南涝北旱不赈济，在宫里怒斥海公公伺候的太勤，害朕都胖了。", "char_start": 329, "char_end": 375}, {"paragraph_id": "P011", "field": "body", "index": 11, "text": "其奈海公公何？", "char_start": 376, "char_end": 383}], "images": [], "lexical": {"node_counts": {"paragraph": 11}, "divergence": false, "divergence_count": 0}}, "reading": {"status": "read", "reader_id": "deepseek-v4.1-flash", "started_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "completed_at": "2026-09-20T00:00:00+08:00", "image_checked": false, "batch_id": "r001-b0579"}, "analysis": {"question_context": "提问者问题：为什么一直感觉有股力量在让自己变愚蠢？；本文初读记录作者正文线索。", "content_units": [{"unit_id": "U001", "paragraph_refs": ["P001", "P002", "P003", "P004", "P005", "P006", "P007", "P008", "P009", "P010", "P011"], "summary": "围绕“海公奈何”的原文驱动初步概括，待独立复核。", "role": "thesis"}], "main_claims": [{"claim_id": "C001", "claim_type": "author_explicit", "attribution": "author", "modality": "asserted", "statement": "作者开篇提出：“不要自作多情，没有谁在争取把你变愚蠢，ta们只是尝试从你一切的欲望中盈利。”", "evidence_refs": ["E001"]}], "argument_steps": ["从开篇命题进入正文。", "其余步骤待独立复核。"], "concept_usage": [], "examples_and_targets": [], "conditions": [], "rhetoric_and_tone": "初读未作完整修辞分类，待复核。", "unresolved_questions": ["论证、事实依据与概念边界需复核。"]}, "provisional_tags": {"status": "provisional", "domain_candidates": [], "issue_candidates": [], "text_function_candidates": [], "object_candidates": [], "working_keywords": []}, "evidence_refs": [{"evidence_id": "E001", "paragraph_id": "P001", "field": "body", "paragraph_index": 1, "quote": "不要自作多情，没有谁在争取把你变愚蠢，ta们只是尝试从你一切的欲望中盈利。", "char_start": 0, "char_end": 37, "relation": "supports"}], "notes": "原文驱动最低限度初读；尚未完成逐段独立复核。"}
